{"chapter-slug":"rwInterlude – The Antinium Wars (Pt-2)","paragraph":25,"wording":"[Protector]","event":"named","id":"f1166ec6-6c00-5dd8-850d-0a1091bd898c"}
{"chapter-slug":"rw7-17 S","paragraph":938,"wording":"[Protector]","event":"named","holder-quote":"Mirn hesitated. He flicked a blade out of his side pocket. Both edges were razor-sharp. You could open someone’s throat with it in a moment. The [Protector] looked at Onieva. She was drinking another potion.","id":"013d9ccd-0d5a-515b-8157-8a2a69576faf"}
{"chapter-slug":"rw7-20","paragraph":1636,"wording":"[Protector]","event":"named","holder-quote":"Mirn gazed up at Magnolia’s stylized dress. At Pyrde, Wuvren. The [Protector] spoke longingly.","id":"09851e49-1eba-597f-b0ad-c64a0f487691"}
{"chapter-slug":"rw7-51","paragraph":697,"wording":"[Protector]","event":"named","holder-quote":"Mirn would have picked them out with his eyes closed, [Protector] that he was.","id":"ac02593f-8b27-50c5-a98d-a92b60c5c9c0"}
{"chapter-slug":"rw8-44 O","paragraph":146,"wording":"[Protector]","event":"named","holder-slug":"mirn","holder-quote":"As they partied out the night in Oteslia, Mirn, the [Protector] of Pallass’ secret bar, a Sentry as they called him, former [Soldier], and friend to Saliss of Lights…and Onieva, asked a question that really cut down on his personal enjoyment of the night.","id":"14f38bbc-2af1-5943-92d2-1ff1a4af075e"}
{"chapter-slug":"rw8-44 O","paragraph":420,"wording":"[Protector]","event":"named","holder-slug":"mirn","holder-quote":"The Gnoll’s smile vanished as she realized this wasn’t a joke or light commentary, Mirn was serious. The [Protector] glared at Esse.","id":"4dd9db5e-de10-5d7c-ad51-7150c2bbb6c6"}
{"chapter-slug":"rw8-44 O","paragraph":440,"wording":"[Protector]","event":"named","holder-slug":"mirn","holder-quote":"The [Protector] grimaced. Onieva was a rare case in that when she went out, there was almost no way to trace her back to Saliss. In a sense, she was freer than anyone here…so long as she was Onieva.","id":"31c9d807-c9e8-5443-a933-c5edca5f6d00"}
{"chapter-slug":"rw8-44 O","paragraph":564,"wording":"[Protector]","event":"named","holder-slug":"mirn","claimed":true,"claimed-by-slug":"mirn","holder-quote":"“I give it to you about citizens and people I protect. [Protector]. Leave her.”","id":"de96b5fc-68d5-5056-849b-b0ffe0f91eb4"}
{"chapter-slug":"rw8-44 O","paragraph":586,"wording":"[Protector]","event":"named","holder-slug":"mirn","holder-quote":"The [Protector] felt his stomach knot. Onieva looked at him. She lost her smile; she was not a fool, after all.","id":"c549b119-49b0-50da-b20b-b835935bb037"}
{"chapter-slug":"rw8-44 O","paragraph":592,"wording":"[Protector]","event":"named","holder-slug":"mirn","holder-quote":"The [Protector] sat there. Wondering if he should tell her. Wondering what he should say. Would Saliss…?","id":"1baae7e0-08f1-5838-b1f3-8f8976706b34"}
{"chapter-slug":"rw8-39","paragraph":417,"wording":"[Protector]","event":"named","holder-slug":"mirn","holder-quote":"“Mirn?”","id":"b92d7f09-2a8e-5d88-80d3-469c28abe6ec"}
{"chapter-slug":"rw8-39","paragraph":461,"wording":"[Protector]","event":"named","holder-slug":"mirn","holder-quote":"Mirn eyed Saliss. The [Protector] frowned mightily.","id":"eb12290c-5301-5203-89d4-2885c9111485"}
{"chapter-slug":"rw8-55 L","paragraph":247,"wording":"[Protector]","event":"named","holder-quote":"Mirn stared at Saliss and remembered how carefree Onieva had seemed. He hesitated. The [Protector] of Turnscales, one of the only friends of Saliss and Onieva both, hesitated. Because Onieva was the truth, but Saliss was the one everyone knew. This was almost everything Saliss had ever worked for. A cheap, more potent reflection of the shape-shifting potion he had created.","id":"3d95c4b9-9d85-5bbf-8caf-19719897956c"}
{"chapter-slug":"rw8-55 L","paragraph":270,"wording":"[Protector]","event":"named","holder-quote":"The smile lingered as Mirn looked away. The [Protector] took a deep breath, heart pounding, scales tingling. It was too painful to think of, his friend’s decisions and sacrifices. Many stories were like that. Yet—he turned as a Drake, an [Alchemist], stretched and laughed. That smile was so different, for all it had many of the same qualities.","id":"0e910461-3635-5780-b267-172c050e9c0c"}
{"chapter-slug":"rw8-83","paragraph":423,"wording":"[Protector]","event":"named","holder-quote":"The [Protector] stood there, shielding Vetn and Tesy.","id":"e6f6e5ac-218f-52e7-92e7-6ad31831d5ff"}
{"chapter-slug":"rw8-83","paragraph":429,"wording":"[Protector]","event":"named","holder-quote":"He’d recognized Mirn’s class. [Protector].","id":"fd62cd8e-7e31-5f8a-80b6-8d80968e8178"}
